  "notes": [
    "Registry is based on repositories visible through the connected GitHub account and known TRADIX project dossiers; it is not proof that all portfolio storage sources are registered.",
    "TRADIX repository paths for NEXORA, MegaMarket, and EXVARLI are inventoried as separate project scopes and excluded from the TRADIX core scope to avoid double counting.",
    "The standalone NEXORA repository and its dossier/assets stored inside TRADIX are separate storage locations attributed to the NEXORA project; logical usage counts both locations.",
    "The -Green888 repository was observed to be empty. Empty is distinct from inaccessible or unmeasured.",
    "fluffy-happiness is not yet mapped to a confirmed portfolio product and is intentionally isolated under UNCLASSIFIED_ARCHIVE.",
    "Local disks, Railway volume contents, object-storage buckets, backups, and other providers are not yet registered as measurable sources."
